@HospitalAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041
@AccessToken =
@RefreshToken =

### Register
POST {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "memberd_admin",
  "email": "memberd_admin@hospital.local",
  "password": "Pass@123",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Login
POST {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "memberd_admin",
  "password": "Pass@123"
}

### Refresh
POST {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{RefreshToken}}"
}

### Profile
GET {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout
POST {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

{
  "refreshToken": "{{RefreshToken}}"
}

### Admin test route
GET {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Patient Lab Reports - List
GET {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/patients/me/lab-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Patient Lab Reports - Get by Id
GET {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/patients/me/lab-reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Patient Lab Reports - Create (multipart)
POST {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/patients/me/lab-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LabBoundary

--LabBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="testName"

Complete Blood Count
--LabBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="testDate"

2026-04-03
--LabBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resultSummary"

All values are within normal range.
--LabBoundary--

### Patient Lab Reports - Update (multipart)
PUT {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/patients/me/lab-reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=LabBoundaryUpdate

--LabBoundaryUpdate
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="testName"

Complete Blood Count (Recheck)
--LabBoundaryUpdate
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="testDate"

2026-04-04
--LabBoundaryUpdate
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resultSummary"

Updated summary from recheck.
--LabBoundaryUpdate
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="removeExistingFile"

false
--LabBoundaryUpdate--

### Patient Lab Reports - Download
GET {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/patients/me/lab-reports/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Patient Lab Reports - Delete
DELETE {{HospitalAPI_HostAddress}}/api/patients/me/lab-reports/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
